        SYNTAX          DisplayString (SIZE(1..32))
        MAX-ACCESS      not-accessible
        STATUS          current
        DESCRIPTION
            "The name of this profile entry. If the objects
             esDhcpROption82RemoteIdType or esDhcpROption82CircuitIdType
             set as expertUdf, the follow value fill in the profile name,
             and then the profile will bind with remote ID or circuit ID."
        ::= { esDhcpROption82ExUdfProfileEntry 1 }

